Upstream trainer
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This product includes software from Uni-OPD (https://github.com/WenjinHou/Uni-OPD, Apache-2.0), upstream commit
08fcec0; its license file is kept as miles/LICENSE-Uni-OPD. Files modified by the DN-MOPD authors carry a "Modified
by the DN-MOPD authors (2026)" line, and the complete set of changes against the upstream commit is provided in
patches/.

This product includes software from miles (https://github.com/radixark/miles, Apache-2.0), as distributed inside
Uni-OPD. The miles license file (miles/LICENSE) states: "Copyright 2025 Zhipu AI". miles describes itself as a fork of
slime (https://github.com/THUDM/slime).

